WEBVTT

00:09.034 --> 00:10.137
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.241 --> 00:11.827
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.931 --> 00:13.310
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.413 --> 00:15.448
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.551 --> 00:18.379
♪ Ooh!
♪ 哦！

00:18.482 --> 00:20.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.517 --> 00:22.551
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.655 --> 00:24.379
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.482 --> 00:26.344
♪ Spongebob
Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤！ ♪

00:26.448 --> 00:28.655
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.758 --> 00:30.172
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.275 --> 00:32.379
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.482 --> 00:34.379
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!♪Ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.482 --> 00:36.379
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.482 --> 00:38.793
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.896 --> 00:40.344
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.448 --> 00:43.931
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:52.310 --> 00:56.068
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部

00:56.172 --> 00:59.655
[and NICKELODEON]
[和尼克频道]

01:07.586 --> 01:08.689
Oh!
哦！

01:08.793 --> 01:10.793
Pardon me, young lady.
请原谅我，年轻的女士。

01:13.862 --> 01:15.551
What a fox.
真是一只狐狸啊。

01:22.724 --> 01:25.310
Ooh!
哦！

01:28.275 --> 01:31.275
You're all mine,
you sweet Krabby Patty.
你都是我的
你可爱的蟹蟹帕蒂。

01:31.379 --> 01:33.241
Ooh, whoo!
哦，呼！

01:39.793 --> 01:43.172
Initiating launch sequence.
启动启动序列。

01:43.275 --> 01:45.965
Krabby Patty, here I come!
克拉比帕蒂，我来了！

01:46.068 --> 01:48.586
Eh, I hope I don't miss again.
嗯，希望不要再错过了。

01:50.241 --> 01:54.586
Reunited, and it's going
to feel so good!
重逢，一切都会过去
感觉真好！

02:00.448 --> 02:02.724
Oh, ho, ho, sweet wampum.
哦，嗬，嗬，甜甜的贝壳。

02:02.827 --> 02:06.034
Huh?! What's that?!
啊？！那是什么？

02:06.137 --> 02:07.827
Squidward, where are you?!
章鱼哥，你在哪里？！

02:07.931 --> 02:10.689
Shield me with your forehead!
用你的额头保护我！

02:10.793 --> 02:12.275
So...
所以...

02:12.379 --> 02:17.482
it was just another failed
Krabby Patty theft attempt
这只是又一次失败
克拉比帕蒂盗窃未遂

02:17.586 --> 02:20.724
by my arch-competitor, Plankton.
由我的主要竞争对手 Plankton 提供。

02:22.620 --> 02:25.344
For a second there,
I mistook you for a threat
有那么一秒钟，
我误以为你是威胁

02:25.448 --> 02:27.758
but you're just
a dirty, little man.
但你只是
一个肮脏的小男人。

02:27.862 --> 02:30.896
So long, shrimp!
久违了，虾！

02:33.827 --> 02:37.000
Curse you, Mr. Krabs!
诅咒你，蟹老板！

02:38.689 --> 02:40.482
Ouch!
哎哟!

02:44.655 --> 02:47.655
So, typical day of failure,
I see, huh, darling?
所以，典型的失败日，
我明白了，嗯，亲爱的？

02:47.758 --> 02:49.206
Oh, can it, computer wife.
哦，可以吗，电脑老婆。

02:49.310 --> 02:51.137
Can't you see I'm exhausted?
你没看到我已经筋疲力尽了吗？

02:51.241 --> 02:53.482
Why don't you go
make yourself useful
你为什么不走
让自己变得有用

02:53.586 --> 02:55.758
and synthesize me up some grub?
并为我合成一些食物？

02:55.862 --> 02:58.275
Yes, Your Majesty.
是的，陛下。

02:58.379 --> 03:00.862
What do we got here?
我们在这里得到了什么？

03:02.620 --> 03:04.000
Oh, goodie!
哦，好家伙！

03:04.103 --> 03:06.758
Holographic meatloaf again.
又是全息肉饼。

03:06.862 --> 03:09.241
When am I going to get
some realfood?
我什么时候才能得到
一些真正的食物？

03:09.344 --> 03:11.413
Mr. Krabs gets to eat real food.
蟹老板可以吃到真正的食物了。

03:11.517 --> 03:13.241
Just look at his daughter.
只要看看他的女儿就知道了。

03:13.344 --> 03:15.586
She's as big as a whale.
她像鲸鱼一样大。

03:15.689 --> 03:19.620
I wish I could be successful
like Mr. Krabs.
我希望我能成功
就像蟹老板一样。

03:19.724 --> 03:23.241
I wish I could somehow
just switch lives with him
我希望我能以某种方式
只是和他交换生活

03:23.344 --> 03:26.862
just to know what it's like.
只是想知道那是什么样子。

03:27.965 --> 03:29.448
Then why don't you just use
那你为什么不直接使用

03:29.551 --> 03:32.862
that Switch-Lives-Just-to-Know-
What-It's-Like-O-Macrofier thing
那开关-活着-只是为了知道-
O-Macrofier 是什么样的东西

03:32.965 --> 03:34.000
you built last Tuesday?
你上周二建的吗？

03:35.482 --> 03:37.275
What a brilliant idea!
多么绝妙的主意啊！

03:37.379 --> 03:39.862
Your parents
must have been, like
你的父母
一定是，就像

03:39.965 --> 03:41.827
part computer or something.
部分计算机或其他东西。

03:41.931 --> 03:43.379
Ah...
啊...

03:45.689 --> 03:46.000
Now, let's see here.
现在，让我们看看这里。

03:46.103 --> 03:47.758
No.
不。

03:47.862 --> 03:48.758
No.
不。

03:48.862 --> 03:49.896
No.
不。

03:50.000 --> 03:51.517
Aha!
啊哈！

03:51.620 --> 03:52.344
Well, I hate to leave you, Karen
好吧，我不想离开你，凯伦

03:52.448 --> 03:54.620
but you know what they say:
但你知道他们怎么说：

03:54.724 --> 03:57.758
"a rolling stone gathers
no algae."
“滚石聚集
没有藻类。”

04:04.551 --> 04:06.172
Ah!
啊!

04:13.310 --> 04:15.206
Oh, dear Neptune above!
哦，上面亲爱的海王星！

04:15.310 --> 04:17.827
What happened last night?
昨晚发生了什么？

04:17.931 --> 04:19.862
Huh?
啊？

04:19.965 --> 04:21.448
What's this?
这是什么？

04:23.241 --> 04:26.379
"Mr.Plankton"?
“浮游生物先生”？

04:28.965 --> 04:30.275
Who the davey...?
戴维是谁……？

04:35.379 --> 04:37.310
Huh? I'm in the Krusty Krab.
啊？我在蟹堡王里。

04:37.413 --> 04:41.310
And that means the life switcher
这意味着生活的切换者

04:41.413 --> 04:42.172
was a success!
很成功！

04:42.275 --> 04:45.758
The Krusty Krab is mine!
蟹堡王是我的了！

04:45.862 --> 04:47.068
Corporate casual.
商务休闲。

04:47.172 --> 04:49.172
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

04:49.275 --> 04:51.379
Two deluxe Krabby Patties.
两份豪华蟹肉饼。

04:53.827 --> 04:55.034
At last!
终于！

04:57.241 --> 04:59.275
There you are, sir.
就在这儿，先生。

04:59.379 --> 05:00.448
Two deluxe...
两间豪华...

05:00.551 --> 05:02.413
Ahoy, there,
Mr. Plankton.
哎哟，那里，
浮游生物先生。

05:02.517 --> 05:04.965
Er, uh, hey, there,
uh, Spongebob.
呃，呃，嘿，那里，
呃，海绵宝宝。

05:05.068 --> 05:07.275
Uh, Spongebob...
呃，海绵宝宝...

05:07.379 --> 05:08.965
Yes, sir?
是吗，先生？

05:09.068 --> 05:11.862
I'm going to need
to take one of these patties
我需要
拿一块肉饼

05:11.965 --> 05:14.655
back to my office
for, uh... bun inspection.
回到我的办公室
用于，呃...包子检查。

05:14.758 --> 05:16.068
I'm afraid you can't do that
恐怕你做不到

05:16.172 --> 05:18.034
Mr. Plankton.
浮游生物先生。

05:18.137 --> 05:19.586
But why not?
但为什么不呢？

05:19.689 --> 05:21.044
Because that patty is
for the customer, sir.
因为那个馅饼是
为了客户，先生。

05:21.068 --> 05:23.379
The customer?
客户？

05:23.482 --> 05:25.241
I'll boil the customer
in hot oil
我来煮顾客
在热油中

05:25.344 --> 05:27.655
and I'll rip out his...!
我会撕掉他的……！

05:27.758 --> 05:31.586
I mean, yes, of course,
for the lovely customer.
我的意思是，是的，当然，
为了可爱的顾客。

05:31.689 --> 05:34.413
But you can
take these
patties, sir.
但你可以
拿这些
馅饼，先生。

05:34.517 --> 05:35.827
I made them on the off chance
我偶然做了它们

05:35.931 --> 05:37.034
you decided to instigate
你决定煽动

05:37.137 --> 05:39.103
some bun inspection
today, Mr. Plankton, sir.
一些包子检查
今天，浮游生物先生，先生。

05:39.206 --> 05:42.758
Uh, yes.
Uh, very nice.
呃，是的。
呃，非常好。

05:42.862 --> 05:44.103
Um, thanks.
嗯，谢谢。

05:47.275 --> 05:48.379
All mine!
都是我的！

05:48.482 --> 05:50.103
It's finally all mine!
终于都是我的了！

05:50.206 --> 05:51.103
The patties...
肉饼...

05:51.206 --> 05:53.103
the wealth...
财富...

05:53.206 --> 05:54.379
the notoriety...
恶名...

05:54.482 --> 05:56.344
the... Spongebob?
海绵宝宝？

05:56.448 --> 05:57.689
What do you want?
你想要什么？

05:57.793 --> 06:00.310
Well, it's just that
it's Tuesday again, sir
嗯，仅此而已
又到了星期二，先生

06:00.413 --> 06:02.965
and I was wondering
if I could have my...
我想知道
如果我能拥有我的...

06:03.068 --> 06:04.551
uh... my, uh...
呃……我的，呃……

06:04.655 --> 06:05.965
weekly performance review.
每周绩效评估。

06:06.068 --> 06:08.172
Review?
审查？

06:08.275 --> 06:09.758
Oh, yes, please, sir, please!
噢，是的，求你了，先生，求你了！

06:09.862 --> 06:11.655
But I've never reviewed
anything...
但我从来没有评论过
任何...

06:11.758 --> 06:13.896
except for those foreign
exercise videos
除了那些外国的
锻炼视频

06:14.000 --> 06:14.896
my cousin sent me.
我表弟发给我的。

06:15.000 --> 06:15.896
Oh, please, sir!
哦，拜托，先生！

06:16.000 --> 06:19.034
I want to make you
so happy and proud!
我想让你
如此高兴和自豪！

06:19.137 --> 06:21.034
Ah, you're doing fine.
啊，你做得很好。

06:21.137 --> 06:22.586
Now leave me to my work.
现在让我继续工作吧。

06:22.689 --> 06:24.896
Mmm...
嗯...

06:25.000 --> 06:26.448
But sir...
但是先生...

06:26.551 --> 06:29.724
I thought I sent
you away, Cretan!
我以为我发送了
你走开，克里特岛！

06:29.827 --> 06:33.689
But sir, there's got to be
something I need to improve on.
但是先生，一定有
我需要改进的地方。

06:33.793 --> 06:35.310
Anything!
任何事物！

06:35.413 --> 06:37.275
All right, the sauce.
好吧，酱汁。

06:38.344 --> 06:39.448
Wh... what?
什...什么？

06:39.551 --> 06:40.724
The sauce, I don't know.
酱汁我不知道。

06:40.827 --> 06:42.310
You're using
too much sauce, okay?
你正在使用
酱太多了好吗？

06:42.413 --> 06:43.482
Review's over.
审核完毕。

06:46.310 --> 06:47.310
What?
什么？

06:49.620 --> 06:50.862
What's the matter with you?
你怎么了？

06:50.965 --> 06:53.172
All I said was
a little too much sauce.
我所说的只是
酱汁有点太多了。

06:53.275 --> 06:54.344
It's no big deal, really.
这没什么大不了的，真的。

06:57.896 --> 07:00.206
What do you want from me,
a promotion?
你想从我这里得到什么
促销？

07:00.310 --> 07:02.793
A pro... a promot...
a promotion?!
专业人士……晋升……
促销？！

07:02.896 --> 07:05.103
Uh, sure, kid, you're, uh...
呃，当然，孩子，你是，呃...

07:05.206 --> 07:06.448
you're on register now.
您现在正在注册。

07:07.931 --> 07:08.931
Register?
登记？

07:10.137 --> 07:12.206
Glad that's over.
很高兴一切都结束了。

07:19.724 --> 07:23.379
Spongebob, do you remember
that little talk we had
海绵宝宝你还记得吗
我们的闲聊

07:23.482 --> 07:25.103
about personal space?
关于个人空间？

07:25.206 --> 07:27.862
It's okay, Squidward,
I'm official. Look!
没关系，章鱼哥
我是官方的。看！

07:29.551 --> 07:31.379
Co-cashier?!
副收银员？！

07:31.482 --> 07:34.068
So, have you two
known each other long?
那么，你们两个
认识多久了？

07:35.689 --> 07:37.827
You can't do this to me,
Mr. Plankton!
你不能这样对我
浮游生物先生！

07:37.931 --> 07:40.482
If you think I'm going
to stand out there all day
如果你认为我会去
整天站在那里

07:40.586 --> 07:41.586
listening to...
听...

07:45.724 --> 07:48.931
then you must have coral
wedged in your frontal lobe!
那你一定有珊瑚
楔入你的额叶！

07:49.034 --> 07:50.862
So what do you want me to do
about it?
那你想让我做什么
关于它？

07:50.965 --> 07:54.103
I'd like my view
to be a little less yellow
我想要我的观点
颜色不要那么黄

07:54.206 --> 07:55.586
if you know what I mean.
如果你明白我的意思。

07:56.413 --> 07:59.586
Hope you like gray.
希望你喜欢灰色。

07:59.689 --> 08:02.551
Hey, Squidward, I can see you
through this little window.
嘿，章鱼哥，我能看见你
透过这个小窗。

08:04.379 --> 08:06.206
Now, no more intrusions.
现在，不再有任何入侵。

08:06.310 --> 08:09.827
I'd like to begin writing
the memoirs of my success story.
我想开始写作
我的成功故事的回忆录。

08:09.931 --> 08:11.689
So everyone just stay the...
所以大家就呆在...

08:11.793 --> 08:13.034
Daddy!
爸爸！

08:13.137 --> 08:15.931
Daddy! Daddy, Daddy,
Daddy, Daddy, Daddy!
爸爸！爸爸，爸爸，
爸爸，爸爸，爸爸！

08:18.586 --> 08:20.206
Just tell Daddy what you want!
只要告诉爸爸你想要什么就可以了！

08:20.310 --> 08:21.379
Daddy!
爸爸！

08:21.482 --> 08:23.206
He's very busy!
他很忙！

08:23.310 --> 08:27.931
Could I please have a, um...
an advance on my allowance?
我可以请一个，嗯...
预支我的津贴？

08:28.034 --> 08:30.517
If it'll get you
out of my antennae.
如果它能得到你
从我的触角里出来。

08:30.620 --> 08:32.241
Go crazy.
发疯吧。

08:32.344 --> 08:33.896
One dollar!
一美元！

08:34.000 --> 08:36.137
You hateme!
你恨我！

08:45.206 --> 08:47.103
Ow!
噢！

08:47.206 --> 08:48.206
You!
你！

08:48.310 --> 08:49.448
Me?
我？

08:49.551 --> 08:51.103
You think this is funny?
你觉得这很有趣吗？

08:51.206 --> 08:53.413
In a cosmic sort of way, yes.
从宇宙的角度来看，是的。

08:53.517 --> 08:55.034
Well, Mr. Funny Man
嗯，有趣的人先生

08:55.137 --> 08:58.448
is this how you get
your sick kicks?!
这就是你得到的
你有病吗？！

08:58.551 --> 09:01.103
What? It's just
an ordinary Krabby...
什么？这只是
一只普通的蟹...

09:01.206 --> 09:03.103
Oh, my goodness!
哦，我的天啊！

09:03.206 --> 09:04.413
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

09:04.517 --> 09:06.586
I tried,
Mr. Plankton.
我尝试过，
浮游生物先生。

09:06.689 --> 09:07.931
I really did.
我真的做到了。

09:08.034 --> 09:09.862
Oh, what now?
哦，现在怎么办？

09:09.965 --> 09:11.517
A customer ordered a medium soda
一位顾客点了一杯中杯苏打水

09:11.620 --> 09:13.068
and I gave him a large.
我给了他一个大的。

09:13.172 --> 09:15.620
I gave him a large!
我给了他一个大的！

09:15.724 --> 09:18.758
I've soiled
the good Krusty Krab name!
我弄脏了
蟹堡王的好名字！

09:18.862 --> 09:19.965
Soiled it! Soiled it...!
弄脏了！弄脏了……！

09:24.827 --> 09:26.413
I command you to stop that.
我命令你停止这样做。

09:26.517 --> 09:28.137
Stop that, and return
to your post!
停下来，然后返回
到你的帖子！

09:28.241 --> 09:29.241
Soiled it!
Soiled it...!
弄脏了！
弄脏了……！

09:29.275 --> 09:31.896
Where's the off button
on this thing?
关闭按钮在哪里
在这件事上？

09:32.000 --> 09:35.586
Okay, Daddy, I've decided
I'm going to run away.
好吧，爸爸，我决定了
我要逃跑。

09:35.689 --> 09:37.620
Run away and find a newdaddy!
赶紧逃走，去找个新爸爸吧！

09:37.724 --> 09:39.413
Make it stop!
让它停下来！

09:42.482 --> 09:43.206
What, did I say the secret word?
什么，我说了密语了吗？

09:43.310 --> 09:44.310
No, sir.
不，先生。

09:44.379 --> 09:46.827
He's back.
他回来了。

09:46.931 --> 09:49.034
Who's back? What?
谁回来了？什么？

09:49.137 --> 09:50.137
What was that?!
那是什么？

09:50.241 --> 09:52.931
Man your stations!
Red alert! Red alert!
管理你的车站！
红色警报！红色警报！

09:53.034 --> 09:55.068
Take cover!
掩护！

09:56.586 --> 09:58.379
Take cover from what?!
躲避什么？！

09:58.482 --> 10:00.310
He's around here somewhere.
他就在这附近的某个地方。

10:00.413 --> 10:01.413
There he goes!
他走了！

10:01.448 --> 10:03.310
What? Who? Where?
什么？ WHO？在哪里？

10:03.413 --> 10:05.137
Somebody tell me!
有人告诉我吗！

10:05.241 --> 10:06.931
Some say he crawled out
有人说他是爬出来的

10:07.034 --> 10:09.965
from the lowest trench
in the ocean.
从最低的沟渠
在海洋中。

10:10.068 --> 10:13.241
He's the saltiest
of all of the sea dogs.
他是最咸的
所有的海狗。

10:13.344 --> 10:16.068
He's the most hated creature
in Bikini Bottom.
他是最让人讨厌的生物
在比基尼底部。

10:16.172 --> 10:19.482
And he's finally got
a Krabby Patty!
而他终于得到了
蟹肉饼！

10:21.586 --> 10:24.896
Krabs?! What the barnacle
is going on here?!
螃蟹？！什么藤壶
这是怎么回事？！

10:25.000 --> 10:26.862
It's your arch-competitor...
Krabs!
这是你的主要竞争对手...
螃蟹们！

10:26.965 --> 10:29.379
His goal in life
is to steal a Krabby Patty
他的人生目标
就是偷一个蟹肉饼

10:29.482 --> 10:31.068
and ruin our restaurant.
并毁了我们的餐厅。

10:31.172 --> 10:32.517
That's terrible!
太可怕了！

10:32.620 --> 10:34.724
Yeah! But the worst part
of it is...
是的！但最糟糕的部分
其中...

10:36.344 --> 10:39.517
Good grief, he's naked!
天哪，他赤身裸体！

10:40.965 --> 10:44.344
Clothe me if you can,
silly landlubbers!
如果可以的话给我穿衣服
愚蠢的旱鸭子！

10:45.965 --> 10:48.103
I'm going to make you
eat those words, Krabs!
我要让你
吃掉这些话吧，螃蟹们！

10:51.655 --> 10:54.896
No shirt, no shoes...
no service!
没穿衬衫，没穿鞋子……
没有服务！

11:01.724 --> 11:03.172
Huh?!
啊？！

11:03.275 --> 11:05.827
Ah, you got me!
啊，你抓住了我！

11:05.931 --> 11:07.965
Well, at least it's underwire.
好吧，至少它是有钢圈的。

11:08.068 --> 11:10.137
Here's your stinking patty!
这是你的臭肉饼！

11:10.241 --> 11:11.586
I don't understand.
我不明白。

11:11.689 --> 11:12.803
Is there a gas leak in here?
这里有煤气泄漏吗？

11:12.827 --> 11:16.172
Knick-knack, the patty's back.
小窍门，馅饼回来了。

11:16.275 --> 11:18.275
You did it, Mr. Plankton.
你做到了，浮游生物先生。

11:18.379 --> 11:20.517
Victory screech!
胜利的尖叫！

11:26.206 --> 11:29.758
Enjoy your victory screech,
Plankton
享受你胜利的尖叫，
浮游生物

11:29.862 --> 11:34.793
because someday the Krabby Patty
formula will be mine!
因为有一天蟹肉饼
公式将是我的！

11:34.896 --> 11:36.551
You'll never get this formula
你永远不会得到这个公式

11:36.655 --> 11:38.172
you twisted fiend!
你这个扭曲的恶魔！

11:38.275 --> 11:39.482
Oh, but I will!
哦，但我会的！

11:39.586 --> 11:42.344
Even if I have
to come back tomorrow
即使我有
明天回来

11:42.448 --> 11:45.034
and the next day
and the next day
和第二天
和第二天

11:45.137 --> 11:46.448
and the next day
和第二天

11:46.551 --> 11:48.620
and the next day
and the next day
和第二天
和第二天

11:48.724 --> 11:51.172
and the next day
and the next day
和第二天
和第二天

11:51.275 --> 11:53.000
and the next day next day
以及后天 后天

11:53.103 --> 11:55.689
and the next day
and the next day
和第二天
和第二天

11:55.793 --> 11:56.827
and the next day...
然后第二天...

11:56.931 --> 11:58.310
Phone call,
Mr. Plankton.
电话，
浮游生物先生。

11:58.413 --> 12:00.620
The next day, and the next day
后天，后天

12:00.724 --> 12:03.448
and the next day
and the next day...
和第二天
然后第二天...

12:07.586 --> 12:09.758
It's not worth it!
这不值得！

12:09.862 --> 12:12.275
It's just not worth it!
这根本不值得！

12:12.379 --> 12:13.793
Good-bye, everyone.
再见，大家。

12:13.896 --> 12:16.448
I'll remember you all
in therapy.
我会记住你们所有人
在治疗中。

12:19.482 --> 12:21.413
Holographic meatloaf...
全息肉饼...

12:21.517 --> 12:22.586
my favorite!
我最喜欢的！

12:41.758 --> 12:44.379
Ah! Goo Lagoon...
啊!古泻湖...

12:44.482 --> 12:46.068
where the sun is hot
太阳很热的地方

12:46.172 --> 12:48.068
and the sunbathers
和日光浴者

12:48.172 --> 12:50.275
are oh, so cool.
哦，太酷了。

12:50.379 --> 12:51.379
What a beautiful day.
多么美好的一天啊。

12:51.448 --> 12:54.103
You said it, pal.
你说过了，朋友。

12:54.206 --> 12:56.482
Can you believe that sun?
你能相信那个太阳吗？

12:56.586 --> 12:59.172
I could look at it all day.
我可以看一整天。

12:59.275 --> 13:00.482
Uh, Patrick?
呃，帕特里克？

13:00.586 --> 13:03.206
What?
什么？

13:03.310 --> 13:04.448
Nothing.
没有什么。

13:04.551 --> 13:05.344
So, how's that tan coming?
那么，晒黑是怎么来的呢？

13:05.448 --> 13:06.448
I don't know.
我不知道。

13:06.517 --> 13:09.310
Let me check.
让我检查一下。

13:09.413 --> 13:10.413
Looking good.
看起来不错。

13:10.448 --> 13:12.379
How's yours?
你的怎么样？

13:12.482 --> 13:14.275
Just a minute.
请等一下。

13:16.793 --> 13:21.137
I could have sworn
I was laying on my back.
我本可以发誓
我仰面躺着。

13:27.482 --> 13:29.655
Larry! Larry!
拉里！拉里！

13:29.758 --> 13:31.448
Larry! Larry!
拉里！拉里！

13:31.551 --> 13:35.758
Hey, it's Larry, the lifeguard.
嘿，我是救生员拉里。

13:35.862 --> 13:38.517
Mr. Lifeguard,
can I feel
your muscle?
救生员先生，
我能感觉到吗
你的肌肉？

13:38.620 --> 13:40.793
Sure. Don't scratch
the paint.
当然。不要抓伤
油漆。

13:40.896 --> 13:43.482
Lifeguard, how's the tubage?
救生员，管子怎么样？

13:43.586 --> 13:45.551
Gnarly, dudes.
粗俗，伙计们。

13:45.655 --> 13:48.551
All right, yeah!
Whoo-hoo!
好吧，是啊！
呼呼！

13:48.655 --> 13:51.379
Lifeguard, can
you point out
the snack bar?
救生员可以
你指出
小吃店？

13:51.482 --> 13:52.793
Right over there.
就在那里。

13:52.896 --> 13:54.275
But you guys are way too old
但你们已经太老了

13:54.379 --> 13:55.689
and unsightly for my beach.
而且对我的海滩来说也不美观。

13:55.793 --> 13:57.320
And I'm afraid I'm going
to have to ask you to leave.
我恐怕我要走了
不得不请你离开。

13:57.344 --> 13:59.827
So polite.
很有礼貌。

13:59.931 --> 14:02.275
Just like we raised him.
就像我们抚养他一样。

14:02.379 --> 14:03.379
What a guy.
真是个家伙啊。

14:03.482 --> 14:06.068
Is it any wonder
he's so popular?
有什么奇怪的吗
他这么受欢迎？

14:06.172 --> 14:09.724
Just imagine
if Iwere a lifeguard.
想象一下
假如我是一名救生员。

14:15.344 --> 14:18.827
That would be so cool.
那真是太酷了。

14:18.931 --> 14:21.551
Oh, what do you want
to be a lifeguard for?
哦，你想要什么
成为一名救生员？

14:21.655 --> 14:23.379
Nobody really likes those guys.
没有人真正喜欢这些家伙。

14:23.482 --> 14:25.448
For he's a jolly, good fellow...
因为他是一个快乐的好人...

14:25.551 --> 14:27.034
Being a lifeguard is so dumb.
当救生员真是太愚蠢了。

14:27.137 --> 14:30.344
All they do is blow, blow,
blow on their stupid whistles
他们所做的就是吹，吹，
吹响他们愚蠢的口哨

14:30.448 --> 14:33.379
rub, rub, rub that white stuff
on their noses
擦擦擦那个白色的东西
在他们的鼻子上

14:33.482 --> 14:37.206
and show off their gross
并炫耀他们的毛病

14:37.310 --> 14:38.758
misshapen bodies.
畸形的身体。

14:38.862 --> 14:40.793
Dude, put that thing away.
伙计，把那东西收起来。

14:40.896 --> 14:42.931
There are, like, children here.
这里有，比如，孩子。

14:46.862 --> 14:48.896
I'm going to the snack bar.
我要去小吃店。

14:49.000 --> 14:51.034
Who needs to be a lifeguard?
谁需要成为救生员？

14:51.137 --> 14:52.241
I'm cool.
我很酷。

14:55.655 --> 14:57.724
I'm every bit as cool as Larry.
我和拉里一样酷。

14:57.827 --> 15:00.379
And if I'm not,
let me be struck by...
如果我不是，
让我震惊...

15:01.862 --> 15:04.586
A flying ice cream truck...
会飞的冰淇淋车...

15:06.241 --> 15:07.241
and live!
并生活！

15:10.689 --> 15:12.275
Please, do not land
请不要着陆

15:12.379 --> 15:15.586
flying ice cream trucks
on the bathers.
飞行冰淇淋车
在沐浴者身上。

15:15.689 --> 15:17.965
Oh...
哦...

15:18.068 --> 15:20.206
Spongebob, you okay?
海绵宝宝，你还好吗？

15:20.310 --> 15:22.758
Hey!
嘿！

15:22.862 --> 15:25.241
I didn't know
you were a lifeguard.
我不知道
你是一名救生员。

15:25.344 --> 15:26.344
Lifeguard?
救生员？

15:26.413 --> 15:27.413
The nose.
鼻子。

15:27.931 --> 15:30.379
White stuff.
白色的东西。

15:30.482 --> 15:32.172
You think I'm a lifeguard?
你以为我是救生员吗？

15:32.275 --> 15:34.620
Sure, there's no hiding
the lifeguard look, Spongebob
当然，没有什么可隐藏的
救生员的样子，海绵宝宝

15:34.724 --> 15:36.655
and you've got it.
你已经得到它了。

15:36.758 --> 15:38.379
You really think so?
你真的这么认为吗？

15:38.482 --> 15:39.689
You bet, I do.
你敢打赌，我愿意。

15:39.793 --> 15:41.793
Say, we're a little
shorthanded around here.
说吧，我们还小
这里人手短缺。

15:41.896 --> 15:43.896
How would you like
to work the beach?
你想要怎样
去海滩工作？

15:44.000 --> 15:46.137
I'd love it!
我会喜欢的！

15:46.241 --> 15:47.965
All right.
好的。

15:48.068 --> 15:49.965
Leave that on the bench, Kahuna.
把它放在板凳上，卡胡纳。

15:50.068 --> 15:51.724
Hey, Annette, come here.
嘿，安妮特，过来。

15:51.827 --> 15:54.206
I want you to meet
my buddy, Spongebob.
我想让你见见
我的好朋友，海绵宝宝。

15:54.310 --> 15:56.275
Hi.
你好。

15:56.379 --> 15:59.448
Hey, guy's a lifeguard.
嘿，这家伙是救生员。

16:01.482 --> 16:03.000
It works.
有用。

16:40.896 --> 16:42.000
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

16:42.103 --> 16:44.034
That was the greatest, Larry.
那是最伟大的，拉里。

16:44.137 --> 16:45.379
Yeah.
是的。

16:45.482 --> 16:46.527
Say, how'd you like to take
the second shift?
说吧，你想采取什么方式
第二班？

16:46.551 --> 16:49.068
By myself?
靠我自己吗？

16:49.172 --> 16:50.586
Only if you think you're ready.
仅当您认为自己已经准备好时。

16:50.689 --> 16:51.689
I'm not just ready.
我还没有准备好。

16:51.758 --> 16:54.206
I'm Ready Freddie.
我准备好了，弗雷迪。

16:54.310 --> 16:55.000
It's Larry.
是拉里。

16:55.103 --> 16:57.172
Well, I guess I'll just...
好吧，我想我只会...

16:57.275 --> 16:58.310
Help! Help!
帮助！帮助！

16:58.413 --> 16:58.896
Help!
帮助！

16:59.000 --> 17:00.724
Help! help!
帮助！帮助！

17:00.827 --> 17:03.241
We've got a sinker.
我们有一个沉降片。

17:03.344 --> 17:05.310
Spongebob, let me take this.
海绵宝宝，让我拿走这个。

17:05.413 --> 17:07.655
I haven't seen
any action all day.
我没见过
一整天的任何行动。

17:07.758 --> 17:09.000
Action?
行动？

17:21.241 --> 17:23.344
Please, help.
Please, help.
请帮忙。
请帮忙。

17:34.551 --> 17:36.931
Breathe, darn you!
呼吸，该死的你！

17:45.103 --> 17:47.068
That's the last time
I read and swim.
这是最后一次
我读书和游泳。

17:47.172 --> 17:48.827
You saved my life.
你救了我的命。

17:48.931 --> 17:51.172
Don't mention it.
It's all part of the job.
别提了。
这都是工作的一部分。

17:51.275 --> 17:53.172
You know, Spongebob, the babes
你知道，海绵宝宝，宝贝们

17:53.275 --> 17:55.103
and the big chair are great
和大椅子很棒

17:55.206 --> 17:57.448
but the best part is knowing
you're the only thing
但最好的部分是知道
你是唯一的东西

17:57.551 --> 17:59.689
that stands between
these good people...
介于
这些好人...

17:59.793 --> 18:01.586
Go, go, go, go, go...
走，走，走，走，走……

18:01.689 --> 18:03.931
and a watery grave.
和一个水坟墓。

18:04.034 --> 18:05.965
And that's what it's all about.
这就是全部内容。

18:06.068 --> 18:08.241
Their lives are
in your hands now
他们的生活是
现在在你手中

18:08.344 --> 18:10.586
'cause I got a date
with a tanning booth.
因为我有个约会
配有晒黑亭。

18:10.689 --> 18:11.724
See you.
再见。

18:13.000 --> 18:14.689
But I...
但我...

18:14.793 --> 18:17.827
can't swim.
不会游泳。

18:17.931 --> 18:21.034
Oh, if I'd known
being a lifeguard meant
哦，如果我知道的话
成为一名救生员意味着

18:21.137 --> 18:24.931
guarding their lives,
I would never have said yes.
守护着他们的生命，
我永远不会答应。

18:25.034 --> 18:26.827
Maybe nothing will go wrong.
也许什么都不会出错。

18:26.931 --> 18:28.344
Then when Larry comes back
然后当拉里回来时

18:28.448 --> 18:30.413
I'll tell him
I'm not interested.
我会告诉他
我不感兴趣。

18:30.517 --> 18:32.448
Besides, what's the worst
that could happen?
除此之外，最糟糕的是什么
这可能发生吗？

18:38.310 --> 18:40.793
Emergency!
Everybody out of the water.
紧急情况！
大家都从水里出来了。

18:40.896 --> 18:43.413
Hurry! Emergency!
Out of the water.
匆忙！紧急情况！
从水里出来。

18:43.517 --> 18:45.137
Emergency!
紧急情况！

18:45.241 --> 18:46.793
What's going on, lifeguard?
救生员，怎么了？

18:46.896 --> 18:48.793
What's the big emergency?
有什么大紧急情况？

18:48.896 --> 18:51.379
Uh... there are
sharks in there.
呃……有
里面有鲨鱼。

18:51.482 --> 18:53.862
Hey, that's my family
you're talking about.
嘿，那是我的家人
你说的是。

18:53.965 --> 18:56.137
A... sea monster!
一只……海怪！

18:58.103 --> 19:01.172
You know, we sea monsters
have made great strides
你知道，我们是海怪
取得了长足的进步

19:01.275 --> 19:03.827
in the fields of science
and literature.
在科学领域
和文学。

19:05.758 --> 19:07.241
Uh... somebody went?
呃……有人去了吗？

19:07.344 --> 19:09.413
It's a big lagoon, dude.
这是一个大泻湖，伙计。

19:09.517 --> 19:10.413
Disgusting!
恶心！

19:10.517 --> 19:11.896
No, don't go!
不，别走！

19:29.758 --> 19:32.655
Free ice cream!
免费冰淇淋！

19:33.758 --> 19:35.103
Plenty for everybody.
适合每个人。

19:35.206 --> 19:37.068
One for you, one for you...
一份给你，一份给你……

19:37.172 --> 19:38.275
Okay, everybody got one?
好吧，每个人都有一个吗？

19:38.379 --> 19:39.517
Mmm, yeah!
嗯，是啊！

19:39.620 --> 19:40.620
Mmm...
嗯...

19:42.034 --> 19:45.206
Aha, now I got you.
啊哈，现在我找到你了。

19:45.310 --> 19:48.206
Now, you all have to wait
one hour before you go swimming.
现在，大家必须等待
去游泳前一小时。

19:49.344 --> 19:52.103
But just so you're not tempted.
但只是为了让你不受诱惑。

20:01.724 --> 20:03.517
Ladies and gentlemen
女士们，先生们

20:03.620 --> 20:05.655
the lagoon is closed.
泻湖已关闭。

20:05.758 --> 20:07.551
We like Larry better.
我们更喜欢拉里。

20:07.655 --> 20:12.344
Does Larry ever give you
free ice cream?
拉里有给过你吗
免费冰淇淋？

20:12.448 --> 20:13.241
Ice cream!
冰淇淋！

20:13.344 --> 20:16.517
Did somebody say, "ice cream?"
有人说“冰淇淋吗？”

20:16.620 --> 20:17.103
Where is it?
它在哪里？

20:17.206 --> 20:18.793
Is it here?
是这里吗？

20:18.896 --> 20:20.206
Huh?
啊？

20:20.310 --> 20:22.379
Ice cream! Yay!
冰淇淋！耶！

20:27.758 --> 20:28.793
Cramp!
抽筋！

20:30.724 --> 20:31.965
Oh!
哦！

20:33.862 --> 20:35.827
Holy cow!
圣牛！

20:35.931 --> 20:37.758
Somebody's drowning!
有人溺水了！

20:37.862 --> 20:39.068
Oh, no, that's not possible.
哦，不，那不可能。

20:39.172 --> 20:40.758
The lagoon is closed.
泻湖已关闭。

20:40.862 --> 20:43.172
Dude, get your butt
in the water.
哥们，放开你的屁股
在水中。

20:43.275 --> 20:45.965
If there was anyone in there,
we'd hear them.
如果里面有人的话
我们会听到他们的声音。

20:46.068 --> 20:47.241
Help, help!
救命，救命！

20:47.344 --> 20:49.379
I can't swim!
我不会游泳！

20:49.482 --> 20:52.034
Somebody would be screaming
that they're drowning...
有人会尖叫
他们快要淹死了……

20:52.137 --> 20:53.517
I'm drowning!
I'm drowning!
我快淹死了！
我快淹死了！

20:54.724 --> 20:56.827
They would have to have
crossed the line.
他们必须有
越线了。

20:56.931 --> 20:58.862
I'm drowning
'cause I crossed the line.
我快淹死了
因为我越界了。

20:58.965 --> 21:00.517
Okay, I'll take a look...
好的，我去看看...

21:00.620 --> 21:03.862
but just to prove to you that...
Patrick isn't drowning!
但只是为了向你证明...
帕特里克没有溺水！

21:03.965 --> 21:05.862
Can't swim!
不会游泳！

21:05.965 --> 21:09.620
Butt hurts.
屁股疼。

21:09.724 --> 21:11.241
Ice cream.
冰淇淋。

21:11.344 --> 21:12.965
Hold on, Patrick.
坚持住，帕特里克。

21:13.068 --> 21:14.862
I'm coming.
我来了。

21:17.827 --> 21:19.586
Help, help!
救命，救命！

21:19.689 --> 21:20.724
Don't move.
别动。

21:20.827 --> 21:22.689
Catch this.
抓住这个。

21:26.482 --> 21:29.137
Quit fooling around, man.
Get in the water.
别再胡闹了，伙计。
进入水中。

21:29.241 --> 21:31.275
Help, help!
救命，救命！

21:31.379 --> 21:33.103
Oh, what am I going to do?
Got to think.
哦，我该怎么办？
必须想一想。

21:33.206 --> 21:35.103
Got to think.
Got to run around and think.
必须想一想。
必须跑来跑去思考。

21:35.206 --> 21:37.206
Got to run around
and think at the same time.
得四处奔波
同时思考。

21:37.310 --> 21:38.590
Got to think,
got to have a plan.
必须想一想，
必须有一个计划。

21:38.655 --> 21:40.413
Got to think, think, think.
I've got it!
必须思考、思考、思考。
我明白了！

21:40.517 --> 21:43.275
Patrick can't drown
if there isn't any water.
帕特里克不会被淹死
如果没有水的话。

21:50.655 --> 21:53.241
Well, you're safe now, Patrick.
好吧，你现在安全了，帕特里克。

21:53.344 --> 21:55.379
Help, I'm drowning,
I've got butt cramps
救命啊我快淹死了
我屁股抽筋

21:55.482 --> 21:57.241
I want ice cream
and now it's dark.
我想要冰淇淋
现在天黑了。

22:03.793 --> 22:04.872
Help, help!
Help me, I'm drowning.
救命，救命！
救救我，我快淹死了。

22:04.896 --> 22:07.896
Help.
帮助。

22:08.000 --> 22:09.896
To us.
对我们来说。

22:10.000 --> 22:12.103
Oh!
哦！

22:12.206 --> 22:14.827
Sorry.
Here's your hot dog.
对不起。
这是你的热狗。

22:14.931 --> 22:16.758
Okay, Patrick, here I come.
好吧，帕特里克，我来了。

22:16.862 --> 22:17.931
Oh.
哦。

22:18.034 --> 22:18.896
Come, come 'round Pat.
来吧，过来帕特。

22:19.000 --> 22:20.448
Here I am.
我在这里。

22:20.551 --> 22:22.271
Pat, Pat, no.
Uncle, hold it,
Pat, Pat, stop.
帕特，帕特，不。
大叔，坚持住
帕特，帕特，停下来。

22:22.310 --> 22:24.517
No, Pat, stop.
不，帕特，停下来。

22:24.620 --> 22:25.931
Stop, stop!
停下来，停下来！

22:26.034 --> 22:27.827
Oh. Sorry.
哦。对不起。

22:29.137 --> 22:30.379
Help! Help!
帮助！帮助！

22:31.482 --> 22:34.103
Save me, can't swim.
救救我，我不会游泳。

22:34.206 --> 22:36.482
Patrick, don't.
帕特里克，别这样。

22:36.586 --> 22:38.758
Help.
帮助。

22:38.862 --> 22:40.758
Help, help, help...
救命，救命，救命……

22:40.862 --> 22:42.103
Help!
帮助！

22:42.206 --> 22:44.413
Help us.
We're drowning!
帮助我们。
我们快淹死了！

22:45.241 --> 22:47.241
I wonder what's showing
我想知道正在显示什么

22:47.344 --> 22:49.000
at the movie theater
right about now.
在电影院
就现在。

22:49.103 --> 22:50.931
Good-bye, Patrick.
再见，帕特里克。

22:51.034 --> 22:53.275
Good-bye, ice cream.
再见，冰淇淋。

22:53.379 --> 22:55.068
Help, can't swim. Help, can't swim.
救命，不会游泳。救命，不会游泳。

22:55.172 --> 22:55.931
Oh, no. Oh, no.
哦，不。哦，不。

22:56.034 --> 22:59.689
Spongebob?
海绵宝宝？

22:59.793 --> 23:01.034
Yes, Larry?
是的，拉里？

23:01.137 --> 23:03.482
You're not a lifeguard, are you?
你不是救生员，是吗？

23:03.586 --> 23:04.689
No, Larry.
不，拉里。

23:04.793 --> 23:06.620
Let's go, guys.
我们走吧，伙计们。

23:07.931 --> 23:09.034
Very good.
非常好。

23:09.137 --> 23:10.337
You fellows are learning fast.
你们学得很快。

23:13.241 --> 23:15.310
Ow!
噢！

23:15.413 --> 23:17.310
Butt cramps! Butt cramps!
屁股抽筋！屁股抽筋！

23:17.413 --> 23:24.310
And I still don't
have my ice cream.
而我还是不
吃我的冰淇淋吧。

23:24.413 --> 23:28.413
And NICKELODEON
还有尼克罗迪恩

23:46.689 --> 23:49.793
